---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
const contactEmail = "neo@neotiktok.com";
---

<footer class="neo-footer" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="footer-container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <!-- Coluna 1: Marca, TTSPC Badge, Descrição e Contato -->
      <div class="footer-brand font-display">
        <h3 class="brand-title">
          <span>neøflow</span><span class="footer-slash-coral">/</span><span class="footer-slash-cyan">/</span>
        </h3>
        
        <div class="ttspc-badge font-mono">
          <span class="badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>TTSPC // TikTok Shop Partner Center</span>
        </div>

        <p class="brand-desc">
          A INFRAESTRUTURA ESTÁ PRONTA.<br />SEJA A PRIMEIRA CAMADA DE OPERADORES.
        </p>

        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="contact-pill font-mono">
          <span class="pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>{contactEmail}</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Links Grid (Mobile: 2 Colunas Lado a Lado / Desktop: 2 Colunas Independentes) -->
      <div class="footer-nav-wrap">
        <!-- Coluna 2: Territórios / Navegação Operacional -->
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="col-title font-mono">TERRITÓRIOS</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li>
              <a href="/shop" class="touch-target">
                <span class="link-code font-mono">01</span>
                <span>Shop &amp; Sellers</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/creators" class="touch-target">
                <span class="link-code font-mono">02</span>
                <span>Creators &amp; Growth</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/marketing" class="touch-target">
                <span class="link-code font-mono">03</span>
                <span>Marketing &amp; Ads</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tech" class="touch-target">
                <span class="link-code font-mono">04</span>
                <span>Tech &amp; APIs</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Coluna 3: Links Legais Obrigatórios -->
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4 class="col-title font-mono">CONFORMIDADE</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li>
              <a href="/legal/privacidade" class="touch-target">
                <span>Privacidade (LGPD)</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/legal/termos" class="touch-target">
                <span>Termos de Uso</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Divisor Visual -->
    <div class="footer-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Rodapé de Disclaimer Legal e Copyright compactados -->
    <div class="footer-bottom font-mono">
      <p class="legal-notice">
        <strong>Aviso:</strong> A <strong>neøflow</strong> é uma parceira de tecnologia independente operando no ecossistema <strong>TikTok Shop Partner Center (TTSPC)</strong>. As marcas registradas TikTok e TikTok Shop pertencem às suas respectivas detentoras. Em conformidade com a LGPD e o CDC.
      </p>
      <div class="copyright">
        <span>© {currentYear} neøflow // Official TikTok Partners.</span>
        <span class="corp-tag">Flowoff Marketing e Assessoria Digital LTDA — CNPJ: 43.376.355/0001-92</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .neo-footer {
    background-color: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    /* Mobile-first: respeita Safe Area Bottom de iPhones/Androids com gesture navigation */
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem calc(3rem + var(--sab)) 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .footer-container {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 2fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .brand-title {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-slash-coral {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    margin-left: 2px;
  }

  .footer-slash-cyan {
    color: var(--neo-cyan);
  }

  .ttspc-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--neo-acid);
    background: rgba(215, 254, 9, 0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(215, 254, 9, 0.22);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--neo-acid);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neo-acid);
    animation: pulseGlow 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes pulseGlow {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.45; transform: scale(0.85); }
  }

  .brand-desc {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .contact-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--neo-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    min-height: 38px;
  }

  .contact-pill:hover,
  .contact-pill:active {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.15);
    border-color: var(--neo-cyan);
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .pill-dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--neo-cyan);
  }

  .footer-nav-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .col-title {
    color: var(--neo-white);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Ergonomia Mobile: Tap target mínimo de 44px com touch feedback */
  .touch-target {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }

  .link-code {
    color: var(--neo-cyan);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .touch-target:hover,
  .touch-target:focus-visible {
    color: var(--neo-acid);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .touch-target:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
    color: var(--neo-acid);
  }

  .touch-target:hover .link-code,
  .touch-target:active .link-code {
    color: var(--neo-acid);
  }

  .footer-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--neo-border), transparent);
    margin: 2.25rem 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-notice {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .legal-notice strong {
    color: var(--neo-white);
  }

  .copyright {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .corp-tag {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════
     TIKTOK MOBILE APP-SHELL OPTIMIZATIONS
     ══════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .neo-footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.15rem calc(2.5rem + var(--sab)) 1.15rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.25rem;
    }

    .footer-nav-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
      border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-ios);
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .touch-target {
      min-height: 44px; /* WCAG 2.5.5 touch target size */
      padding: 0.35rem 0.25rem;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .footer-nav-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
